            \. An instructive example of this construction is spelled out in detail at
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hypergraph"} hypergraph
          %h3#action_groupoid Action Groupoid
          %p
            In the case that
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi 𝒞
                  %mo =
